      "text": "### Mini-360 Buck Converter\n- IN+: 12V (VCC)\n- IN-: GND\n- OUT+: 3.3V\n- OUT-: GND"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_esp32",
      "x": 1150,
      "y": 950,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 450,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### ESP32-C3 SuperMini\n\n- **3.3V Pin** <─── Mini360 OUT+\n- **GND Pin** <─── Common GND\n\n- **GPIO 3** <─── Node A (ADC)\n\n- **GPIO 0** ───> RGB (R)\n- **GPIO 1** ───> RGB (G)\n- **GPIO 10** ──> RGB (B)\n\n- **GPIO 4** ───> MOSFET 1 (Fan)\n- **GPIO 5** ───> MOSFET 2 (Aux)"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_rgb",
      "x": 1650,
      "y": 850,
      "width": 250,
      "height": 180,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### RGB LED\n(Common Cathode)\n\n- R: from GPIO 0\n- G: from GPIO 1\n- B: from GPIO 10\n- K: to GND"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_fets",
      "x": 1650,
      "y": 1150,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 200,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### MOSFET Modules\n(D4184 PWM Control)\n\n- FET 1: Fan Speed\n- FET 2: Spare/Aux\n- Control: GPIO 4, 5"
    }
